<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land to raise US$150 million.</title>
<headline>DBS Land to raise US$150 million.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Land Ltd said on Wednesday it was planning to raise at least US$150 million through an issue of redeemable convertible cumulative preference shares (RCCPS) of US$1 each.  </p>
<p>The company said proceeds from the proposed issue would be used by the group to refinance existing borrowings.</p>
<p>It added that in-principle approval had been received from the Stock Exchange of Singapore for the listing and quotation of the RCCPS.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
